1. Conditional 
>If 
Syntax:
if condition{
//block of code
}
Example:
import java.util.Scanner;
public class Conditions {
    public static void main(String[] args){
        Scanner sc=new Scanner(System.in);
        System.out.println("Enter a number");
        int num=sc.nextInt();
        if(num<=10){
            System.out.println("Condition is true");
        }

    }
}
